          "ObservationStore::open takes &Path (line 46 in storage.rs)",
          "Both forms are valid Rust, but the inconsistency adds cognitive overhead when wiring stores \u2014 a developer must check each open() signature to know whether to pass path.as_path() or just path"
        ],
