          "subscriptions() -> &SubscriptionManager similarly exposes the raw manager",
          "write_tuple() and write_tool_result() both call self.space.out() AND self.subscriptions.notify() together \u2014 the bridge's value is that it keeps these two calls in sync; the accessors allow callers to call space.out() without notify(), breaking the invariant"
