          "The pattern 'match result { Ok(code) => if !errexit_exempt && errexit && code != 0 { Exit } else { Normal }, Err(Exit(c)) => Exit, Err(Errexit(c)) => Exit, Err(ref e) => { eprintln!; let exit_code = match e { CommandNotFound => 127, PermissionDenied => 126, _ => 1 }; if !errexit_exempt && errexit { Exit } else { Normal } }' appears essentially verbatim for SimpleCommand, Try, Match, While/Until/Case arms.",
